00:11:32.790 --> 00:11:35.860
wants and have full control of what's,

00:11:35.860 --> 00:11:38.670
um, what the first block of the plaintext is.

00:11:38.670 --> 00:11:41.125
Yeah, so if you're encrypting a password,

00:11:41.125 --> 00:11:45.340
