the server and the parity bit tells me if the server accepts or rejects,

00:25:35.930 --> 00:25:37.615
I know what the, what the bit is.

00:25:37.615 --> 00:25:40.730
And I can iterate that over and over again and recover the bit,

00:25:40.730 --> 00:25:43.440
the message one the plaintext, one bit at a time.

